type: dataset
title: "Eval Atlas: Mapping physical AI safety evaluations"
abstract: >-
  A curated, scored map of published safety evaluations for robots and
  embodied AI systems, with an analysis of gaps in their coverage of the
  risks of advanced physical AI.
